  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/617/header-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"175\"></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">一款以槍械、任務、科技、頭目戰與姿勢動作為特色的冒險模組包。</span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/620/description-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"200\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 本模組包內含槍械與生活品質改良模組，將徹底改變你的原版遊戲體驗。可與好友同樂或獨自遊玩。開始執行任務並收集戰利品，擊敗頭目贏取豐厚獎勵。&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 按下 I 鍵開啟任務選單，可查閱詳細資訊、領取獎勵、購買道具，還能在武器賭場試手氣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 透過槍匠工作台打造超過 100 種槍械與彈藥</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 按下 K 鍵開啟表情姿勢選單，在朋友面前展現各種動作與表情</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 按下 L 鍵開啟成就選單，查看基於成就系統的任務與賭場內容</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 專為低配備系統設計（若幀數過低請停用著色器）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 支援多人連線。可直接透過內建的 Essential 模組與好友連線，或下載官方伺服器套件建立完整的多人生存伺服器。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">💣 本模組包以 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TacZ 模組</a>為基礎，並以鑽石作為主要貨幣</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/621/screenshots-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"200\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/606/2025-04-23_09-44-44-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/613/2025-04-23_10-44-20-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1183/6/2025-05-09_23-26-07-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/610/2025-04-23_10-47-40-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/611/2025-04-23_03-19-13-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1170/391/2025-04-27_02-46-51-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/612/2025-04-23_10-53-38-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1180/218/2025-05-07_09-27-45-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1184/294/2025-05-11_00-07-09-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></p><p>觀賞 TacZ 模組的精彩內容：</p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:1024px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bG9-8agYVyI\" width=\"1024\" height=\"601\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>認識本模組包收錄的 GamerPotion 系列模組：</p><div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkquesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/20/638809215458543440.png\" alt=\"DarkQuesting\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkbindings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/22/638809215919453329.png\" alt=\"DarkBindings\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkrtp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/23/638809216123403947.png\" alt=\"DarkRTP\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkloot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/24/638809216321911073.png\" alt=\"DarkLoot\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkmining\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgec